{\an8}<i>♪ Forever be free ♪</i>

1807
01:33:33,441 --> 01:33:38,029
{\an8}<i>♪ A great mystery ♪</i>

1808
01:33:38,071 --> 01:33:42,951
{\an8}<i>♪ Of reality ♪</i>

1809
01:33:50,166 --> 01:33:55,547
{\an8}<i>♪ My deepest blue ocean ♪</i>

1810
01:33:55,588 --> 01:33:59,883
{\an8}<i>♪ My world, my truth ♪</i>

1811
01:33:59,884 --> 01:34:05,098
{\an8}<i>♪ Always the moon
means you ♪</i>

1812
01:34:05,140 --> 01:34:10,478
{\an8}<i>♪ The flower,
the root, the tree ♪</i>

1813
01:34:10,520 --> 01:34:15,900
{\an8}<i>♪ The frisson
of swishing leaves ♪</i>

1814
01:34:15,942 --> 01:34:22,490
{\an8}<i>♪ The stars and space
between the wonder ♪</i>

1815
